		{
			id: "87661584296B8B70"
			title: "Sail to the Cairn Chapel and the Drowned Lighthouse"
			subtitle: "Out past the ridge."
			icon: "artifacts:cross_necklace"
			description: ["Pip: \"The chapel's called the Cairn and the lighthouse is called Drowned and I named the boat Biscuit!\"", "", "Take the boat out with Nella and Pip, following the Explorer's Compass from the last payout to the Cairn Chapel and then the Drowned Lighthouse. A waystone stands at each and the chest is under the beacon beam. Bring back the Cross Necklace from the chapel and the Snorkel from the lighthouse.", "", "You keep the Warding Lamp — you'll want it in the cave under the Works."]
			x: 6.0d
