			icon: "minecraft:echo_shard"
			description: ["Tobin: \"Dead sculk, no Warden — I checked twice, then again with a stick. Mind the third lantern, it hangs crooked.\"", "", "Follow Tobin's lantern line down into the echo cave under the Works and bring back 1 Echo Shard. The Warding Lamp from the boat trip holds the dark off the whole chamber.", "", "The deep survey data is what sites the quarry."]
