		{
			id: "77BA3AD249428FE7"
			title: "Deliver 1,024 Cobblestone From Network Stock to the Granary"
			subtitle: "The first load."
			icon: "minecraft:cobblestone"
			description: ["Bram: \"Rock into the box, box into the granary. That's a public works, not a hole in a hill.\"", "", "Pattern the quarry's output so cobble goes to the granary, ore goes to the Pulverizer and the rest goes to the void, then let one full cycle land: 1,024 cobblestone out of network stock into the granary. Bram wants to see the sorting work before he calls it a public works, and the quarry keeps running afterwards.", "", "Stage town_provides: Oda's shelves restock themselves from your network from now on, permanently."]
			x: 14.0d
