			title: "Hang the Quarry-Copper Bell on the Marked Post"
			subtitle: "Big Copper."
			icon: "minecraft:bell"
			description: ["Pip: \"I get to ring it, and I already named it! It's called Big Copper!\"", "", "Hang the Bell on the marked post in the finished square — Marnie's, off the firewood stacks, recast in the quarry's own copper.", "", "Every resident comes out for it. Pip has been the courier since December; from today he is also the bell-ringer, and nobody is getting that rope off him."]
			x: 16.0d
